{"id":"e69e849d9714457a","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-modal-k-k4-g.md","title":"The Book’s Modal Axiom Systems K, K4, and G","display":"df-modal-k-k4-g — The Book’s Modal Axiom Systems K, K4, and G","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-modal-k-k4-g","aliases":["92-df-modal-k-k4-g"],"display":"df-modal-k-k4-g — The Book’s Modal Axiom Systems K, K4, and G","source":"第 XI 章 pp. 132–133（PDF 149–150）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-modal-language]]","[[92-df-formal-system]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-modal-k-k4-g"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-modal-k-k4-g</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-modal-k-k4-g — The Book’s Modal Axiom Systems K, K4, and G"},{"key":"source","html":"第 XI 章 pp. 132–133（PDF 149–150）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4c908091e8e31a3b\" href=\"?note=4c908091e8e31a3b\" title=\"92-df-modal-language\">92-df-modal-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6a1ff87567369c3c\" href=\"?note=6a1ff87567369c3c\" title=\"92-df-formal-system\">92-df-formal-system</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(F,H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>；有限证明三元组约定见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6a1ff87567369c3c\" href=\"?note=6a1ff87567369c3c\" title=\"92-df-formal-system\">92-df-formal-system</a>。</li>\n<li>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{\\Box}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\cup\\{\\Box F:F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\}\">\\(A_{\\Box}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\cup\\{\\Box F:F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\}\\)</span> 的任意布尔赋值 a，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_a\">\\(v_a\\)</span> 按底、蕴涵递归，顶层 Box 子式视为布尔原子。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf K_{\\Box},\\mathsf{K4}_{\\Box},\\mathsf G_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathsf K_{\\Box},\\mathsf{K4}_{\\Box},\\mathsf G_{\\Box}\\)</span> 是以下定义的三个系统，不是算术 G。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}k\\text{-}k4\\text{-}g}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\nv_a(\\bot)&amp;=0,&amp;v_a(p_i)&amp;=a(p_i),&amp;v_a(\\Box F)&amp;=a(\\Box F),\\\\\nv_a(F\\supset H)&amp;=\\max(1-v_a(F),v_a(H)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Taut}_{\\Box}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}:\\forall a\\in\\{0,1\\}^{A_{\\Box}}\\;v_a(F)=1\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ax2}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\Box(F\\supset H)\\supset(\\Box F\\supset\\Box H):F,H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ax3}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\Box F\\supset\\Box\\Box F:F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ax4}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\Box(\\Box F\\supset F)\\supset\\Box F:F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{MP}_{\\Box}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\langle F,F\\supset H\\rangle,H):F,H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Nec}_{\\Box}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\langle F\\rangle,\\Box F):F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf K_{\\Box}&amp;\\coloneqq(\\Sigma_{\\Box},\\operatorname{Taut}_{\\Box}\\cup\\operatorname{Ax2},\\operatorname{MP}_{\\Box}\\cup\\operatorname{Nec}_{\\Box}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{K4}_{\\Box}&amp;\\coloneqq(\\Sigma_{\\Box},\\operatorname{Taut}_{\\Box}\\cup\\operatorname{Ax2}\\cup\\operatorname{Ax3},\\operatorname{MP}_{\\Box}\\cup\\operatorname{Nec}_{\\Box}),\\\\\n\\mathsf G_{\\Box}&amp;\\coloneqq(\\Sigma_{\\Box},\\operatorname{Taut}_{\\Box}\\cup\\operatorname{Ax2}\\cup\\operatorname{Ax3}\\cup\\operatorname{Ax4},\\operatorname{MP}_{\\Box}\\cup\\operatorname{Nec}_{\\Box}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}k\\text{-}k4\\text{-}g}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\nv_a(\\bot)&amp;=0,&amp;v_a(p_i)&amp;=a(p_i),&amp;v_a(\\Box F)&amp;=a(\\Box F),\\\\\nv_a(F\\supset H)&amp;=\\max(1-v_a(F),v_a(H)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Taut}_{\\Box}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}:\\forall a\\in\\{0,1\\}^{A_{\\Box}}\\;v_a(F)=1\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ax2}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\Box(F\\supset H)\\supset(\\Box F\\supset\\Box H):F,H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ax3}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\Box F\\supset\\Box\\Box F:F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ax4}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\Box(\\Box F\\supset F)\\supset\\Box F:F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{MP}_{\\Box}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\langle F,F\\supset H\\rangle,H):F,H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Nec}_{\\Box}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\langle F\\rangle,\\Box F):F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf K_{\\Box}&amp;\\coloneqq(\\Sigma_{\\Box},\\operatorname{Taut}_{\\Box}\\cup\\operatorname{Ax2},\\operatorname{MP}_{\\Box}\\cup\\operatorname{Nec}_{\\Box}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{K4}_{\\Box}&amp;\\coloneqq(\\Sigma_{\\Box},\\operatorname{Taut}_{\\Box}\\cup\\operatorname{Ax2}\\cup\\operatorname{Ax3},\\operatorname{MP}_{\\Box}\\cup\\operatorname{Nec}_{\\Box}),\\\\\n\\mathsf G_{\\Box}&amp;\\coloneqq(\\Sigma_{\\Box},\\operatorname{Taut}_{\\Box}\\cup\\operatorname{Ax2}\\cup\\operatorname{Ax3}\\cup\\operatorname{Ax4},\\operatorname{MP}_{\\Box}\\cup\\operatorname{Nec}_{\\Box}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 G 通常在现代文献记为 GL；这里沿用 K⊆K4⊆G 的模式列表，保留 A3。Nec 是从已证明的定理 F 得到 Box F，不能在开放假设下无条件使用。</p>\n<p>Taut 是把每个 Box 子式当作命题原子的布尔重言式，没有预先加入反射或 T 公理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box F\\supset F\">\\(\\Box F\\supset F\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-modal-language","status":"resolved","id":"4c908091e8e31a3b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-modal-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formal-system","status":"resolved","id":"6a1ff87567369c3c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formal-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formal-system","status":"resolved","id":"6a1ff87567369c3c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F,H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$；有限证明三元组约定见 [[92-df-formal-system]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F,H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"A_{\\Box}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\cup\\{\\Box F:F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"v_a","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf K_{\\Box},\\mathsf{K4}_{\\Box},\\mathsf G_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}k\\text{-}k4\\text{-}g}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\nv_a(\\bot)&=0,&v_a(p_i)&=a(p_i),&v_a(\\Box F)&=a(\\Box F),\\\\\nv_a(F\\supset H)&=\\max(1-v_a(F),v_a(H)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Taut}_{\\Box}&\\coloneqq\\{F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}:\\forall a\\in\\{0,1\\}^{A_{\\Box}}\\;v_a(F)=1\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ax2}&\\coloneqq\\{\\Box(F\\supset H)\\supset(\\Box F\\supset\\Box H):F,H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ax3}&\\coloneqq\\{\\Box F\\supset\\Box\\Box F:F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ax4}&\\coloneqq\\{\\Box(\\Box F\\supset F)\\supset\\Box F:F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{MP}_{\\Box}&\\coloneqq\\{(\\langle F,F\\supset H\\rangle,H):F,H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Nec}_{\\Box}&\\coloneqq\\{(\\langle F\\rangle,\\Box F):F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf K_{\\Box}&\\coloneqq(\\Sigma_{\\Box},\\operatorname{Taut}_{\\Box}\\cup\\operatorname{Ax2},\\operatorname{MP}_{\\Box}\\cup\\operatorname{Nec}_{\\Box}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{K4}_{\\Box}&\\coloneqq(\\Sigma_{\\Box},\\operatorname{Taut}_{\\Box}\\cup\\operatorname{Ax2}\\cup\\operatorname{Ax3},\\operatorname{MP}_{\\Box}\\cup\\operatorname{Nec}_{\\Box}),\\\\\n\\mathsf G_{\\Box}&\\coloneqq(\\Sigma_{\\Box},\\operatorname{Taut}_{\\Box}\\cup\\operatorname{Ax2}\\cup\\operatorname{Ax3}\\cup\\operatorname{Ax4},\\operatorname{MP}_{\\Box}\\cup\\operatorname{Nec}_{\\Box}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Box F\\supset F","display":false}],"bytes":2467,"backlinks":[{"id":"bf4e24a615d3695e","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-modal-k-k4-g]]、[[92-df-modal-arithmetic-realization]]、[[92-thm-smullyan-solovay-completeness]]"},{"id":"f403c224ddb070f8","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-119","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-modal-language]] → [[92-df-modal-k-k4-g]] → [[92-df-modal-associated-system]] → [[92-prop-modal-system-types]]。"},{"id":"ec030649243aa657","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"26dafbc0a373cac4","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"71962c0a446ff8b2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-148","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[92-df-modal-k-k4-g]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-104","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-modal-k-k4-g]]"}],"outgoing":["4c908091e8e31a3b","6a1ff87567369c3c"]}